# Backup job (P1-51, PO decisions O47 and O48). Given to the `backup` tool service and SeaweedFS (to verify the key's
# signatures) only. The object-store key reads and lists the evidence and audit-anchor buckets, nothing else.
# BACKUP_AGE_RECIPIENT is the age public key backups are encrypted to; it is not secret, and it cannot decrypt.
# Placeholders only. scripts/dev/init-env.sh fills the key; scripts/ops/backup-keys.sh fills the recipient.
S3_BACKUP_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_BACKUP_SECRET_KEY=
BACKUP_AGE_RECIPIENT=
